{{- /* Keybindings for the ChatGPT desktop app -- the merged ChatGPT/Codex
       app, bundle id com.openai.codex -- which reads this file from
       CODEX_HOME: a flat array of {command, key}, key being an accelerator or
       null to unbind.  The app's own keyboard-shortcuts editor writes the same
       file, so a shortcut recorded there loses to the next apply; change it
       here instead.  Read at startup, so a running app keeps the old keys.

       Its parser takes cmdorctrl/commandorcontrol, command/cmd/super,
       control/ctrl, alt/option and shift, case-insensitively, and treats the
       remaining token as the key; a handful of names (esc, up, pgup, space,
       plus) are spelled out and everything else is the literal character.
       That and the command ids are read out of the 26.1120.50957 bundle,
       where the commands are declared with their defaultKeybindings.

       control is both control keys -- neither this file nor Electron can tell
       left from right -- and caps lock is left control by way of karabiner, so
       caps+' reaches this too.

       Listing a command here drops all of its built-in keys, which is why
       toggleSidebar names cmd+b as well: several entries for one command are
       allowed and each one binds.  Its other default, cmd+shift+s, is let go
       rather than disabled; it collided with nothing and earns no line.

       openAvatarOverlay is "Toggle Mini", the floating pet, and its macOS
       default is option+space at shortcutScope "os-global" -- registered
       system wide, so it fires whether or not the app has focus.  That is the
       input source switch, symbolic hotkey 60 in bootstrap_mac.sh, and an app
       taking it globally is how that stops working.  Hence null, which is not
       "fall back to the default": a null entry leaves its command with no key
       at all, whatever else here names it.  Mini is then reachable only from
       its Toggle Mini menu item, which suits the pet-visibility and
       avatar-overlay-pet-visible settings in .chezmoidata/codex.toml. */ -}}
[
  { "command": "openAvatarOverlay", "key": null },
  { "command": "toggleSidebar", "key": "Control+'" },
  { "command": "toggleSidebar", "key": "CmdOrCtrl+B" }
]
